-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">River Caves</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/River_Shop\" title=\"River Shop\">River Shop</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">20</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"AOE Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">AOE Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Pickaxe Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickaxe Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">200 Credits</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.51.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 1st, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote><p><i><big>\"A pickaxe carved from the strongest of rocks and infused with the power of Lumite crystals; use this tool and leave no stone unturned.\"</big></i></p></blockquote>\n<p>The <b>Gleam Harvester</b> is a pickaxe that can be purchased from the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Shop\" title=\"River Shop\">River Shop</a> for 200 Lumite Credits.\n</p><p>The <b>Gleam Harvester</b> pickaxe has the largest impact radius on ore - meaning the impact is likely to spread throughout the entire ore deposit. But there is no guarantee that this pickaxe will mine every piece of ore or ordinary stone in one go. \n</p><p>This pickaxe mines large chunks of ore in 2-4 hits +/- depending on size.\n</p><p><b>Notes:</b> \n</p><p>-The <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertain_Pickaxe\" title=\"Uncertain Pickaxe\">Uncertain Pickaxe</a> is a better pickaxe for everyday use.  But even so, the <b>Gleam Harvester</b> pickaxe is not without its merits.\n</p><p>-In terms of size, the <b>Gleam Harvester</b> pickaxe is the largest pick in the game relative to the player's height. \n</p><p>-This pickaxe emits a light green glow (which may slightly illuminate the area around you no further than 1 meter) this is due to the material from which it is made (<a href=\"/wiki/Lumite\" title=\"Lumite\">Lumite</a>).\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/06/Gleam_Harvester_Light.png/revision/latest?cb=20240910191408\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The glow from the pickaxe.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/06/Gleam_Harvester_Light.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240910191408\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"106\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Gleam Harvester Light.png\" data-image-key=\"Gleam_Harvester_Light.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Gleam_Harvester_Light.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The glow from the pickaxe.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902012304\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 71/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 66/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019485/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.720      1 Template:Pickaxe\n100.00%   31.720      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2303-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902012304 and revision id 21825. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Pickaxes","Tools"],"links":[{"title":"River Shop","exists":true},{"title":"Lumite","exists":true},{"title":"Uncertain Pickaxe","exists":true}],"images":["Gleam_Harvester.png","Gleam_Harvester_Light.png"]}
